{"at":"2026-02-18T20:21:50.965Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":571,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/faq-mls/","title":"FAQ (MLS & CRM)","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMLS User Manual\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>FAQ (MLS &amp; CRM)</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 4 minutes\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1040 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10350\" class=\"elementor elementor-10350\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab0500f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ab0500f\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cd02e82 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cd02e82\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:57\">PropertyList.es MLS &amp; CRM: Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c56454d elementor-widget elementor-widget-docy_faq\" data-id=\"c56454d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"docy_faq.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"question_inner row\">\r\n    <div class=\"col-lg-3\">\r\n        <div class=\"question_menu\">\r\n                        <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\" id=\"myTab-c56454d\" role=\"tablist\">\r\n                                        <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                            <a href=\"#tab-c56454d-general\" class=\"nav-link active\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"tab-c56454d-general\" aria-selected=\"true\">\r\n                                General                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                                                <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                            <a href=\"#tab-c56454d-listings-properties\" class=\"nav-link \" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"tab-c56454d-listings-properties\" aria-selected=\"false\">\r\n                                Listings &amp; Properties                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                                                <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\r\n                            <a href=\"#tab-c56454d-agents-users\" class=\"nav-link \" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" aria-controls=\"tab-c56454d-agents-users\" aria-selected=\"false\">\r\n                                Agents &amp; Users                            </a>\r\n                        </li>\r\n                                    </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col-lg-9\">\r\n        <div class=\"tab-content question_list mt-0\" id=\"myTabContent-c56454d\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-pane fade  show active\" id=\"tab-c56454d-general\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11765\">\r\n                                    <h4>Does Propertylist.es require a credit card to join?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p><strong>No</strong>, a form of payment is <strong>NOT required</strong> to join. Only if you want to <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">buy credits.</a></p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11764\">\r\n                                    <h4>Is PropertyList.es free to use?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p>Yes, PropertyList.es is FREE to use with <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/credits/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">paid features</a> within the system that are optional.</p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11763\">\r\n                                    <h4>What are the benefits of using PropertyList.es?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p><strong>For Freelancers: </strong><br />\nPropertyList.es allows freelancers to share their listings at no cost. This cost-efficient approach is especially helpful for those starting out in the industry.</p>\n<p><strong>For Agencies: </strong><br />\nAgencies can freely share their properties with a wide audience. Additionally, they can manage staff accounts, listings, events, and documents—all in one place.</p>\n<p><strong>For Developers: </strong><br />\nListing new developments for free on PropertyList.es helps developers reach thousands of agents and buyers. It also facilitates connections with property services that may prove valuable.</p>\n<p><strong>For Property Services: </strong><br />\nWe welcome all services related to property, connect with estate agents, developers, and property seekers, expanding your network and business opportunities.</p>\n<p><strong>For Buyers/Renters:</strong><br />\n1. Extensive Property Listings: PropertyList.es aggregates a wide range of properties, making it easier for buyers and renters to find their ideal home or investment.<br />\n2. Agent Expertise: Buyers and renters can benefit from the expertise of real estate agents associated with the platform. Agents can guide them through the process, answer questions, and provide insights.<br />\n3. Advanced Search Filters: Users can filter properties based on specific criteria (such as location, price range, amenities, etc.), saving time and effort.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.4s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11762\">\r\n                                    <h4>What is an MLS &#038; CRM?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p data-sourcepos=\"8:3-8:53\"><strong>Multiple Listing Service (MLS): </strong>This is a platform specifically designed for real estate agents to share information and collaborate on listings. PropertyList.es facilitates this agent-to-agent communication, allowing agents to expose their listings to a wider pool of potential buyers and renters represented by other agents on the platform totally FREE!</p>\n<p><strong>Customer Relationship Management (CRM):</strong> This is a software that helps agents manage their interactions with clients. PropertyList.es’ CRM features help agents track leads, manage communications, and stay organised throughout the sales or rental process.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.5s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11761\">\r\n                                    <h4>What is PropertyList.es?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p>PropertyList.es is a full-service solution for real estate agents in Spain. It functions as both a Multiple Listing Service (MLS), a Customer Relationship Management (CRM) and Lead Generation platform.</p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"tab-pane fade \" id=\"tab-c56454d-listings-properties\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11768\">\r\n                                    <h4>How can I access property market data on PropertyList.es?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p><strong>Coming Soon &#8211; </strong>PropertyList.es provides access to valuable market data, including trends, comparative analysis tools, and insights into buyer preferences.</p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11767\">\r\n                                    <h4>Can I link/add properties to a contact’s profile?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p>Yes, <a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> allows you to link properties to contacts. <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/link-properties-to-contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn how to do this here.</a></p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11766\">\r\n                                    <h4>How do I list a property on PropertyList.es?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p>You’ll need to be a registered agent with a <a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> account. <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The specific listing process can be found here.</a></p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"tab-pane fade \" id=\"tab-c56454d-agents-users\" role=\"tabpanel\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.1s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11771\">\r\n                                    <h4>How can I assign a contact to a specific agent?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p><a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> allows you to assign contacts to agents for streamlined communication and task management. <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/assign-contact-to-an-agent/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn how to assign your contact a staff member here</a>.</p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.2s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11770\">\r\n                                    <h4>Can I add professional contacts to a client’s profile?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p>Yes, <a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList.es</a> allows you to link professional contacts (lawyers, architects, etc.) to your client’s profile. You can specify the type of professional relationship for better organization. <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/add-professional-contacts-to-a-contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more here.</a></p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                        <div class=\"ques_item fadeInUp\" data-wow-delay=\"0.3s\">\r\n                                <a href=\"#faq-11769\">\r\n                                    <h4>How do I sign up for PropertyList.es?</h4>\r\n                                </a>\r\n                                <p><a href=\"https://agents.propertylist.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sign up for FREE here.</a> <em>(NO credit card information required, ever!)</em></p>\n                            </div>\r\n                                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5dfc5dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5dfc5dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d5c1962 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d5c1962\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:57\"><a style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); font-family: Nunito; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.15px;\" href=\"https://propertylist.es\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Not signed up yet? Get a FREE account and connect with agents throughout Andalucía. Streamline collaboration and close more deals.</a></h3><p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:114\"><a href=\"https://propertylist.es/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-10180\" src=\"/assets/c3849ce8-baf6-40e3-bbce-7e9cdcc58cd8\" alt=\"PropertyList\" width=\"1734\" height=\"671\" srcset=\"/assets/c3849ce8-baf6-40e3-bbce-7e9cdcc58cd8 1734w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-300x116.jpg 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1024x396.jpg 1024w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-768x297.jpg 768w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-20x8.jpg 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-32x12.jpg 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1536x594.jpg 1536w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-600x232.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1734px) 100vw, 1734px\" /></a></p><div> </div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/new-features-roadmap/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tNew Features &amp; Roadmap                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tAdditional Resources                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"FAQ (MLS & CRM) • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}